`\xf4\x8f\xbf\xbf` (U+10FFFF) -> 61065117ffcf9f58bb2814941836be0d9249129e
`\xc3\xa9` (U+00E9) -> 67ec4458d0c3ed6c48686996aae566f301d338a9

Salt errors use `File "pbkdf2.py", line 197, in _setup`; passphrase errors use line 193.
Passphrase is validated BEFORE salt; both BEFORE the iterations<1 ValueError.
